   Persist ->
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
In SAP CPI, the "Persist" function allows you to store message payloads at specific points in an integration flow for later
analysis, auditing, or debugging. This function creates a permanent record of the message data, including its GUID,
 timestamp, and payload. The persisted data can be accessed and retrieved using the SAP Cloud Integration OData API.
 The "Persist" step is a core part of message traceability and helps ensure the integrity of the data flow.
